<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK FEB DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.46 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK FEB DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.46 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Monday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 6.46 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Feb 5			 7,200</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Feb		6,346</p>
<p> Average reserves to Jan 31			   6,742</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,462</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 235</p>
</text>
